  "limits": [
    "Local STEP prototype,not a native Fusion feature tree or manufacturing release",
    "Two nested same-orientation discs approximate a parallel stack at the published reference shortening",
    "Torque must be calibrated directly; spring force curve,friction,creep and torque retention are unmeasured",
    "Fork,tongue,band,pads and cup geometry unchanged from recorded V18 sources",
    "No physical handling,comfort,acoustic,durability or Sony compatibility validation",
    "Fasteners use cosmetic thread envelopes with proposed M4 x 0.7 drawing callouts; thread strength and tolerance classes are not qualified",
    "Experimental exact helical bolt failed the one connected solid check and is excluded from the final assembly",
    "Two nuts are proposed for countertightening; vibration locking and torque retention remain untested",
    "Final pin and nuts changed only; flexible joint mesh still refers to the initial V19 CAD with identical fork and tongue"
